\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 URL Alchemist (V2)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf2 A powerful middleware layer for your browser's navigation, powered by binary Action Packs.
\f1\b0 \
URL Alchemist gives you complete control over your web routing. It intercepts, transforms, and redirects URLs based on your own custom rules. Whether you want to automatically strip out annoying tracking parameters, redirect specific queries, or map hotkeys to custom web workflows, URL Alchemist lets you automate your daily browsing experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \uc0\u55357 \u56960  What's New in the V2 Major Expansion?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Version 2 is a ground-up expansion that introduces 
\f0\b Workspaces
\f1\b0  and 
\f0\b Action Packs
\f1\b0 , providing unparalleled flexibility and power for advanced users:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workspaces & Binary Action Packs:
\f1\b0  Design your own advanced URL routing and text-parsing logic in the new visual Workspace Editor. Once ready, compile your rules into highly efficient, portable \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 .actionpack\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  binary files.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Advanced Regex Builder:
\f1\b0  Craft, test, and debug complex Regular Expressions for URL matching and capture-group extraction directly within the extension using the new built-in Regex Builder panel.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Custom Hotkey Triggers:
\f1\b0  Map custom keyboard shortcuts to specific actions. Trigger workflows like "Search selected text" or "Launch from clipboard" without ever clicking a button.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Secure Sandbox Runtime:
\f1\b0  Complex text parsing, fetching, and URL transformations now run securely in an isolated background sandbox environment for maximum security and performance.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Import & Export:
\f1\b0  Easily back up your Workspaces or share your compiled Action Packs with other users.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Modern Architecture:
\f1\b0  Fully rebuilt from the ground up for Chrome Manifest V3, ensuring lightning-fast performance and future-proof compatibility.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

